OL,3,GNEWSAThousands have power restored in
OL,4,Astorm aftermath
OL,5,
OL,6,FPower has been restored to thousands of
OL,7,Fhomes across Yorkshire after disruption
OL,8,Fcaused by Storm Boelo over the weekend.
OL,10,FAbout 127,000 customers lost power over
OL,11,Fthe weekend across the north of
OL,12,FEngland, but supply had been restored
OL,13,Fto most of them on Sunday night,
OL,14,Faccording to Northern Powergrid.
OL,16,FIn an update at 13:00 GMT on Monday, it
OL,17,Fsaid fewer than 900 households were
OL,18,Fstill without power, almost of which
OL,19,Fwere across West Yorkshire and the
OL,20,FNorth York Moors areas.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
